</style></head><body class="pdf en-US" lang="en-US"><article id="30cf2fef-a309-8085-a272-e065ee3f6bcd" class="page sans"><header><h1 class="page-title" dir="auto"><strong>Network Security and Cryptography</strong></h1><p class="page-description" dir="auto"></p></header><div class="page-body"><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="321f2fef-a309-809e-8a19-ed426acb4731" class="image"><img style="width:2480px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/031b8bd6-8f1a-4c73-b035-f9b4b3629c10/d0940e28-330e-41ec-a55b-68aeb1d0b15d/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4664SXHIX23%2F20260609%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260609T003239Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEPn%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQDD60v%2FGtC1U0XrMNaKIfVf6ZODo11Kk4ShaeZMIuV9mwIhAMQazgUNN80fSrbD6E8c7xGtV7qSOYmyg4lxmdNqmovvKogECML%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1Igz%2F572R%2F19AOns18iMq3APOx3Y0MMvUMdKUE6I0vdf%2F9AciRE1R7WprxxPcTBpvM6yw0h1zq3PknPPS42qh%2B9QXa%2BX6MvR6Mtj3tLTEYM5wPNQeMVuu2ZTI0gkKoWhDiad%2Bt9pyAdhO6xExkc7RNeQtcIpb84ey%2F7ddYNo6%2B5obWobHCVIYlEE04j0tiE641UsAzxwAAqBOxIvVGqD9VAL6EjgAN3N93joiAfq%2BmXigrjkkpUb5vhiXQ8EETUW54fKw6B%2BRTyCoDokAvSxgEVIVgY1z0fRJOuycqcjJU84ldl2ZbNsTSa3R9yiwSsh00%2FZJgVjkm4jr1JDjrz%2BPnJ%2FPpHy%2FQexVdC9iS0e%2F5XfCSR98qxnwzN42YqCZLpBWHjIdpPHHcrzbqmgYRHQjzue3JzTEjxr7ee%2FAULHLmJ5chEXyzWoAoJ84%2BqRWtdY3sq619C0WnaPwI5hjTbWgMVrXTzeGbAgZWelQDSMDOnJinHndfNas%2BilxFBOm8reshcsxnZnsRKNsdapR66c%2ByFToZHggqeVqffJx%2Fefbr2Il1lHVFivgw9uXqQVnEvQm%2B5CpVUo4T4okZvFKtlJxzxMsXuCutXFrGsP9M1eLXg0AHZaBuDbgEm7Me1tT3kot9hcN7Qtj1ZU02FYYqTDRu53RBjqkAQIz3HC1PFDctGU3KR2P%2Be27iRWU2avoqvLW3iRClLJBfez93U%2BK8J3DQ2%2Bhtp0wHRqr9elBw9xcNnMNwINX2yOzU8Sq0BaUPnOil2Rt7QcxeXt5Bi%2BAPdCtbpYO5plIHT5q4U9ba1gZfnKfemnicMxZXcyw4h5nMY2DzMOCQY%2B5p0HLOzaqtpTtRVzRqbNH5wy8E9s8U9qFnFFR0D%2F6bfiRyd%2FE&amp;X-Amz-Signature=c7b